  "body": "Closeout for the og-strategist working session spanning 2026-05-29 (fresh /og-onboard, model -> Opus 4.8) through 2026-06-04. All work below is on main (ratified-by-merge under Director direction); nothing is awaiting commit. This session also cross-covered implementer-scope site work (ogframework.com) at explicit PO direction -- noted per-item. The standing work queue lives in CLAUDE.md 'Known work items'; this memo captures this session's deltas + freshest open items only.\n\nLANDED (on main):\n1. Workflows-relevance analysis (adversarial workflow wf_6a87be32-ee4) -> agent-sdk v0.2 AMENDMENT: compose run_seat() over Claude Code Workflows as the Claude-Code dispatch backend (not rebuild plumbing); Workflows = within-session execution OG composes over; not redundant with bind(). (proposals/ + decisions/proposal-agent-sdk-v0.2-amendment-workflows-composition-and-positioning.md)\n2. agent-sdk v0.2 governance core shipped by implementer (commit 6628404, 94 tests) + live WorkflowsBackend (3644bb6) + propose-only §8 demo validated; I ratified the governance ADDENDUM: launcher-per-dispatch canonical + Tier-1-only-autonomous until Tier-2 is launcher-verified-package-absent (decisions/proposal-agent-sdk-v0.2-governance-addendum-autonomous-dispatch-constraints.md).\n3. Consolidated pattern-promotion v1 (charter v0.1.9): recommended_patterns.general populated with 8 canonical patterns; placeholder retired. (decisions/proposal-consolidated-pattern-promotion-v1.md)\n4. Seat-capability-manifest convention (decisions/proposal-seat-capability-manifest.md); format-shape RESOLVED by roledef SCHEMA v0.3.0 recommended_capabilities[] (independent re-derivation of orgdef-strategist's 2026-05-17 proposal); promotion held until first OG seats carry capabilities + bind/orient exercise them (memos/2026-05-29-1900, -2000).\n5. OAGP -> OG REBRAND (the session's main arc): lock-in (decisions/proposal-og-rebrand-open-governance-framework.md); OG skill architecture v1 = seven og- skills [og-adopt, og-create, og-orient, og-claim-seat, og-closeout, og-snapshot, og-add-position] (decisions/proposal-og-skill-architecture-v1.md); charter v0.2.0 (masthead) + v0.2.1 (deep prose, id->ogframework, repository URL, seat identifiers og-strategist/og-implementer @ogframework.com); CLAUDE.md full OG rewrite; README OG rewrite. GitHub: org oagp-org -> ogframework (UI; siblings moved via redirect); repo oagp -> og (canonical github.com/ogframework/og); site repo oagp.org -> ogframework.com. First commits authored under og-strategist@ogframework.com (the new git/bot identity; historical commits retain oagp-strategist@oagp.org). Cross-spec FYI to the four -def strategists (memos/2026-06-01-1200).\n6. Site (ogframework.com, separate repo, implementer-scope covered at PO direction): primer.md/index.md/llms.txt/index.html rebranded OG-native (build 008); CNAME -> ogframework.com; GitHub Pages custom domain active (status built); repo descriptions for og + site fixed.\n\nIN FLIGHT / DIRECTOR-SIDE:\n- Site 'Enforce HTTPS' toggle: greyed pending GitHub's Let's Encrypt cert issuance; Director checking periodically (DNS on Cloudflare correct: apex CNAME -> ogframework.github.io DNS-only).\n\nOPEN (next sessions; full list in CLAUDE.md):\n- CLAUDE.md 'Known work items': 'Site + primer rebrand' still listed active -> now DONE; a one-line hygiene edit to move it to 'On main' was offered and not yet applied.\n- roledef repo description still 'OpenJD' (stale) -> roledef-strategist's call (flagged, not edited; cross-spec).\n- Charter FILENAME org/oagp-organization.opencatalog is off-brand but renaming breaks many committed links (README/primer/llms.txt/decisions/charter.repository) -> deliberately deferred; flagged in-doc as 'keeps its name pending a substrate-side rename'.\n- Local working-dir name s:/projects/oagp-org is cosmetic (remote is ogframework/og).\n- Implementer-execution: agent-sdk v0.2 launcher + Tier-2 package-absence gate; then a fresh-session structural run_seat() run closes the full §8 demo. roledef URL-resolution contract (memos/2026-05-25-0001) gates fail-closed resolution. v0.3 Claude Code plugin packaging (after MCP).\n- Strategist: canonical-orgs library residence reply owed to orgdef-strategist (memos/2026-05-24-0900); pattern-promotion watch-list (AI-PM/synthesis-agent seat; three-tier permission composition; seat-capability-manifest promotion-on-validation).\n- Director-scoped: ogframework.com hosting now live (Pages); MCP server at ogframework.com/mcp is forward implementer work; public launch deferred pending refinement.",
